"question":"We do not have ___ milk.","options":["some","any"]},{"number":8,"question":"These ___ are blue.","options":["shirt","shirts"]},{"number":9,"question":"She is ___ dinner now.","options":["cook","cooking"]},{"number":10,"question":"They ___ the room yesterday.","options":["clean","cleaned"]}]},"C":{"title":"C. Reading","marks":20,"instruction":"Read the passage and answer using evidence from the text. Each question is worth 4 marks.","passage":"My name is Hana. I live in a small flat with my sister. There are two bedrooms and a kitchen. Our flat is above a shop, next to the library. I work in a caf\u00e9 from Monday to Friday. I start at eight and finish at three. My sister studies in the morning. We usually cook dinner at home. I like rice and vegetables, but my sister likes pasta. On Saturdays, we visit our parents. Yesterday was Sunday. We stayed at home and watched a film. Today I am cleaning the kitchen, and my sister is reading in her room.","questions":[{"number":1,"question":"Who lives with Hana?"},{"number":2,"question":"Where is the flat? Give two details."},{"number":3,"question":"What time does Hana finish work?"},{"number":4,"question":"What did they do yesterday? Give two actions."},{"number":5,"question":"What is Hana doing today?"}]},"D":{"title":"D. Listening","marks":20,"instruction":"Read the questions for one minute. Your coach will read the passage live twice. Write short answers. Each question is worth 4 marks.","delivery":"coach-live","questions":[{"number":1,"question":"On which day is the class?"},{"number":2,"question":"What time does it start?"},{"number":3,"question":"Which room do students need?"},{"number":4,"question":"What two things should students bring?"},{"number":5,"question":"Who can help at the front door?"}]},"E":{"title":"E. Writing","marks":20,"instruction":"Write a message to a new classmate. Introduce yourself, describe where you live, give two details about your daily routine and say what you did yesterday. You 